     "items": [
      "As … as: kasíng- + root + ni/ng (Si Maria ay kasínggandá ni Elena).",
      "Equally: magkasíng- with both subjects side by side (Magkasíntaás kamí).",
      "Kasíng- before a, e, i, o, u, k, g, h, m, n, w, y; kasín- before d, l, r, s, t; kasím- before b, p.",
      "Like: parého, katúlad or gáya + ni/ng.",
      "More than: lalóng / higít na / mas + adjective + káysa kay (person) or káysa sa (place or thing). Not as … as: hindi kasíng-.",
      "Very: magandáng-magandá or nápakagandá. Most: pinakámagandá."
