   ],
   "answer": "as",
   "explain": "Kasíng- and magkasíng- mean as."
  },
  {
   "type": "choice",
   "q": "Fill in: Si Maria ay ___ ni Elena. (Maria is as beautiful as Elena.)",
   "options": [
