 "recap": [
  "As … as: kasíng- + root + ni/ng + B (Si Maria ay kasínggandá ni Elena). Equally: magkasíng- (Magkasíntaás kamí).",
  "The prefix becomes kasín- before d, l, r, s, t and kasím- before b, p.",
  "Parého, katúlad and gáya + ni/ng also mean as … as (Si Maria ay magandá gáya ni Elena).",
  "More than: lalóng / higít na / mas + adjective + káysa kay (person) or káysa sa / kesa (place or thing).",
  "Not as … as: hindi kasíng- (Si John ay hindi kasíndúnong ni Peter).",
  "Very: doubling with a ligature (magandáng-magandá) or nápaka-. Most: pinaká- (pinakámagandá)."
 ]
}